      "id": "claim_12bf53b3359548eaa4f0866112153f7a",
      "statement": "trackAppOpen is fired client-side from html/JS.html DOMContentLoaded (not from doGet, which cannot see the browser User-Agent) with navigator.userAgent + ' | ' + screen.width + 'x' + screen.height; DOMContentLoaded fires once per real page load so the post-action soft re-render does not double-count visits.",
