    {
      "id": "claim_43cb89185455471dbe0728bfbeb1b966",
      "statement": "trackEvent adds engagement_time_msec and session_id so the hit registers as an active GA4 session (a common MP gotcha: without them server events often don't count), reuses the hashed user_id as client_id (no reliable browser id in the iframe), and sets user_id when resolvable to enable returning-vs-new; if GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID or GA4_API_SECRET is unset, trackEvent is a silent no-op.",
